        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The AI assistant now writes a structured note of your conversation in the background while you are still working, so it has a fresh recap ready to use if you pause for more than five minutes or if the conversation gets too long to fit. When you come back, the assistant reads this note instead of the entire raw history, which helps it remember your requests without re-reading every detail. This is an internal efficiency update that does not change how you interact with the tool or affect your account limits; you will not see a new button or option, but the assistant may retain context better after breaks.",
